Equation Listing    SOLVE BuildScenario Using MIP From line 72


---- SupplyArea  =L=  How much area to supply (ac)

SupplyArea(s1)..  - V(res,s1) - V(pump,s1) + Area =L= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     
SupplyArea(s2)..  - 0.333333333333333*V(res,s2) - 0.333333333333333*V(pump,s2) + Area =L= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     

---- NetBen  =E=  Objective Function Revenue minus costs

NetBen..  6000*I(res,cap1) + 10000*I(res,cap2) + 8000*I(pump,cap1) + 8000*I(pump,cap2) + 20*V(pump,s1) + 20*V(pump,s2) - 300*Area + TotalBen =E= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     

---- PumpCap  =L=  Pumping in each season (ac-ft per season)

PumpCap(s1)..  - 401.5*I(pump,cap1) + V(pump,s1) =L= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     
PumpCap(s2)..  - 401.5*I(pump,cap1) + V(pump,s2) =L= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     

---- ResCap  =L=  Reservoir storage within capacity in each time step (ac-ft)

ResCap(s1)..  - 300*I(res,cap1) - 700*I(res,cap2) + Stor(s1) =L= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     
ResCap(s2)..  - 300*I(res,cap1) - 700*I(res,cap2) + Stor(s2) =L= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     

---- RivMassBal  =L=  River mass balance downstream of reservoir in each timestep (ac-ft)

RivMassBal(s1)..  V(pump,s1) - Flow(s1) =L= 730 ; (LHS = 0)
     
RivMassBal(s2)..  V(pump,s2) - Flow(s2) =L= 730 ; (LHS = 0)
     

---- ResMassBal  =E=  Reservoir mass balance in each time step (ac-ft)

ResMassBal(s1)..  V(res,s1) + Stor(s1) + Flow(s1) =E= 600 ; (LHS = 0, INFES = 600 ****)
     
ResMassBal(s2)..  V(res,s2) - Stor(s1) + Stor(s2) + Flow(s2) =E= 200 ; (LHS = 0, INFES = 200 ****)
     

---- BuildChoice  =L=  Can only implement one project size

BuildChoice(res)..  I(res,cap0) + I(res,cap1) + I(res,cap2) =L= 1 ; (LHS = 0)
     
BuildChoice(pump)..  I(pump,cap0) + I(pump,cap1) + I(pump,cap2) =L= 1 ; (LHS = 0)
     
